{
  "about": "שעת סיום יום עסקי (businessDayEndHour): one rule in Python (app/services/business_day.py), TypeScript (client/src/lib/businessDay.ts) and Kotlin (domain/BusinessDay.kt). The business day of a moment is its local date, minus one day when its local hour is before the end hour. A day starts at end-hour:00 local; in a DST gap at the jump, in an overlap at the first occurrence. documentMonths: a Z's documents summed per calendar month of their DOCUMENT date (never the business day) and the cross-month line. Management only: no fiscal date changes. Same bytes in pos-server server/tests/fixtures and pos-android app/src/test/resources; both pin the SHA-256.",
